_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nanashi_gb/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4dbb1c7/uploads/origins/2d24ab35-8685-475a-9b44-8c6e14cb24b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=465e2089fac69f27ca3dd1512e584bab", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4dbb1c7/uploads/origins/2d24ab35-8685-475a-9b44-8c6e14cb24b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=465e2089fac69f27ca3dd1512e584bab, https://si.imgix.net/e4dbb1c7/uploads/origins/2d24ab35-8685-475a-9b44-8c6e14cb24b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70f704be0de532803c53a4628c97525b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4dbb1c7/uploads/origins/2d24ab35-8685-475a-9b44-8c6e14cb24b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b6db6d8402ae4518bc8ca549602b15d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "絵柄がかわいかったのでお願いしたいと思いました！\nわたし霧隠懐希のアバター（オリジナル）のイラストをおねがいします。\n銀髪ロップイヤー、ワインレッドの縦セタで、右目の目尻下にはホクロがあります。\nできたら煙草吸っているといいです。\n\n【参考資料】\nhttps://hub.vroid.com/characters/6510425840377473584/models/1068342681149483471\nhttps://misskey.io/@n4tsuki_k/pages/1697503044271\n\nhttps://misskey.io/@n4tsuki_k/pages/1697503044271", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nanashi_gb/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/53e0c207/uploads/origins/6333a59d-5269-45ea-80fa-e9eaffdfa1d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65852b41e2b72f8552b6f586ed12aaf2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53e0c207/uploads/origins/6333a59d-5269-45ea-80fa-e9eaffdfa1d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65852b41e2b72f8552b6f586ed12aaf2, https://si.imgix.net/53e0c207/uploads/origins/6333a59d-5269-45ea-80fa-e9eaffdfa1d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89758a10709037c0dddc6b99c8bec595 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53e0c207/uploads/origins/6333a59d-5269-45ea-80fa-e9eaffdfa1d6?bg=%2